{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:223","content":{"id":223,"title":"26 病毒是什么","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"997f0124-8548-463d-83a9-789f7fb549d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"病毒是最简单的能自我复制的生物，病毒只是个壳子，里面装着少许几条遗传编码和一些蛋白分子而已，完全依赖其他真正的生物而活。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c2f707f-c2e0-41ad-bf20-94a12c61dd3c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"据估计，地球上有 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"10^{31}","collabId":"e6f28c36-38be-4735-b387-18ac7054ee46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"10^{31}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个病毒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5b9ce26-13ba-4cc4-8fd3-280ad4cab2a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"病毒为了繁荣昌盛，它需要进入细胞内不，它们会攻击受体。病毒外壳上有特殊的蛋白质刺突，可以和细胞表面的某类受体结合。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd1ea5e0-f4a2-4d2e-b3f1-561bb4aed122","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"病毒不会攻击所有细胞，专门攻击特定的猎物，病毒有很多，但是能感染人类的只有 200 种左右。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c9e229e-0604-4200-8e60-07b42e5aa681","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"病毒感染细胞后会接管细胞，不同病毒的机制不同，大体上是把自己的遗传物质注入宿主细胞，让细胞不在生成自己的东西，而是生产大量的病毒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9c2e2d6-4b95-45ed-be90-7d51b89d0142","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有些病毒不会让宿主细胞死掉，而是成为持续的生成病毒的工厂；另一些细胞会迅速将宿主细胞消耗殆尽。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66233321-c58b-4ee8-867a-798c8277b675","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有了外壳的病毒会通过出芽的方式离开宿主细胞，掐下一点细胞膜作为另一重保护壳。还有些病毒会导致细胞解体，释放出细胞的内容物，其中就包含了大量的病毒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ecb4ff9-737f-4bb9-8090-94f70b1fc1d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"致病的病毒非常擅长躲避免疫系统，因为它们繁殖的无比快，它们变异或突变非常快，因为它们没有像细胞那样的机制防止突变。病毒个头小，也不会释放化学物质供免疫系统识别，所以比细菌更难发现。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"232eb630-b6e1-4581-91d5-ba8d9086d0d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分病毒的入侵点：呼吸道黏膜。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"26 病毒是什么","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:223","type":"doc","id":223}}],"prevPage":{"title":"条目 #222","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:222","type":"doc","id":222}},"nextPage":{"title":"27 肺部免疫系统","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:224","type":"doc","id":224}},"createTime":1741655833273,"updateTime":1743303640526,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640526}}